    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong>: &quot;Escape from the Forest&quot; tells the story of a little boy who gets lost in a fantastical forest. You will play as this little boy, seeking the help of other people in the forest and fighting against the monsters within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Genre</strong>: This game is a 2D pixel-style RPG. You will control the little boy to explore in this 2D forest and find a way to escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Defeat the monsters in the forest, help NPCs complete corresponding tasks, make different choices and attempts to achieve different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Endings</strong>: This game has multiple endings. Different decisions made by players will affect the game endings. <u>We encourage players to try multiple times to discover different endings.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Difficulty:</strong> The game has a certain level of difficulty. Once the character dies, all saved games will be cleared. Therefore, you need to allocate gold coins and resources rationally in order to achieve different endings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong>: &quot;Escape from the Forest&quot; tells the story of a little boy who gets lost in a fantastical forest. You will play as this little boy, seeking the help of other people in the forest and fighting against the monsters within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Genre</strong>: This game is a 2D pixel-style RPG. You will control the little boy to explore in this 2D forest and find a way to escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Defeat the monsters in the forest, help NPCs complete corresponding tasks, make different choices and attempts to achieve different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Endings</strong>: This game has multiple endings. Different decisions made by players will affect the game endings. <u>We encourage players to try multiple times to discover different endings.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Difficulty:</strong> The game has a certain level of difficulty. Once the character dies, all saved games will be cleared. Therefore, you need to allocate gold coins and resources rationally in order to achieve different endings.</p>",
